OL,3,GNEWSACall for clarity on RAF asylum
OL,4,Acentre timescale
OL,5,
OL,6,FGovernment officials have indicated the
OL,7,Fformer RAF Linton-on-Ouse site could be
OL,8,Freturned to the Ministry of Defence for
OL,9,Fredevelopment by 2029, the region's
OL,10,Fdeputy mayor has said.
OL,12,FIt comes after a letter from Home
OL,13,FOffice minister Anna Turley to North
OL,14,FYorkshire Council leader Carl Les said
OL,15,Fthe site, "if taken forward" would be
OL,16,Fused to house asylum seekers for "a
OL,17,Fminimum of three years".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
