OL,3,GNEWSACall for clarity on RAF asylum
OL,4,Acentre timescale
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the suggested date of 2029,
OL,7,Fwhich Labour deputy mayor Jo Coles said
OL,8,Fwas made in a meeting with government
OL,9,Fofficials, has prompted calls for
OL,10,Fclarification over how long the site
OL,11,Fwould be in use.
OL,13,FThe Home Office has previously said no
OL,14,Ffinal decision has been made on the
OL,15,Ffuture of the site.
